  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "With only one completed experiment (config_001: rna_only, singleprofile, pca_n2000 → acc 0.485), the most critical uncertainty is whether the image modality carries discriminative signal at all. config_010 (image_only, singleprofile, resnet50) directly tests this by holding profile_setting constant and using a standard encoder, enabling a clean cross-modal comparison against the RNA baseline. If image accuracy is substantially higher, the search should pivot toward image-centric or multimodal configurations; if it is similarly low, the bottleneck likely lies in data quality or task difficulty, and we should focus on RNA representation improvements or multimodal fusion. This single experiment reduces the largest source of strategic uncertainty and will most efficiently guide all subsequent choices under the limited budget."
}

